@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Search the catalogue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=monitor

### Seeded customer profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers

### Catalogue quote (does not reserve stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "lines": [{ "sku": "MON-001", "quantity": 8 }, { "sku": "DOCK-002", "quantity": 2 }]
}

### Place and persist an order (deducts stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "lines": [{ "sku": "MON-001", "quantity": 8 }, { "sku": "DOCK-002", "quantity": 2 }]
}

### Order history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?customerId=CUST-001

### Cancel an order; replace the ID with a placed order ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID/cancel

### Sales summary (cancelled orders excluded from sales)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/sales

### Download order history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exports/orders.csv

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Trade customer: total 1186.92
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Trade",
  "lines": [
    { "unitPrice": 125, "quantity": 8 },
    { "unitPrice": 49.50, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Invalid quantity: HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Retail",
  "lines": [{ "unitPrice": 10, "quantity": 0 }]
}
